<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<main id="main">
  <%- include('../partials/page-hero', { heading: 'Privacy notice', lead: 'How we handle the information you send through this website.' }) %>
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container prose prose--narrow" data-reveal>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you use the enquiry or “Notify me” forms, we receive the details you enter: name, company, email, phone, the service you selected and your message. We do not ask for anything else.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>Only to reply to your enquiry or, for “Notify me”, to tell you when CHA services or import/export operations launch. We don’t sell or share your details for marketing.</p>
      <h2>How it is delivered</h2>
      <p>Form submissions are sent to us by email through the EmailJS service. Basic technical logs may be kept by our hosting provider for security.</p>
      <h2>Stored in your browser</h2>
      <p>The site remembers whether you chose Technology or Import/Export mode using your browser’s local storage. It is not sent to us and you can clear it at any time.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>To have your details corrected or deleted, contact us using the details on the <a class="text-link" href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
